   "titulo": "What's the use of katakana?",
   "texto": [
    "The katakana has the **mismos sonidos** that the Hiragana, but with other signs, more straight and angulous.",
    "It is used for **palabras que vienen de otros idiomas** (almost all of English), for foreign names - yours included - and for countries.",
